    <summary>A word password remover that recovers the forgotten password of your own Word document or removes the editing protection from a .docx or .doc file. Everything runs locally and covers one file or many.</summary>
    <description>Password Remover Software for Word DOCX is a word password remover for Windows that helps you get back into a Microsoft Word file whose password you forgot. It reads .docx and legacy .doc files on the machine itself and uploads nothing. This page is for people who run Chocolatey on one PC or a fleet and want to know what the package installs and what it does.

![Word Password Recovery screenshot 1](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/wpr/wpr-v1-main.png)

## How to use Password Remover Software for Word DOCX

1. Install the package with choco and start the word password remover from the Start menu.
2. Add a single document or a batch of .docx and .doc files.
3. Press Start. The program first tries to unlock the document protection, which needs no password, and then searches for the open password if the file is encrypted.
4. Watch the progress bar until the result appears.

Trial note: this is a free trial, and the unregistered version saves no files. You can run the whole job and look at the result in a pop-up window, but the password appears masked and Save opens a purchase banner. A license removes both limits.

![Word Password Recovery screenshot 2](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/wpr/wpr-v1-found.png)

## Word password recovery for files you own

When a document is encrypted, the program runs a dictionary search with rules. It works best on passwords a person would pick, such as a name or a familiar phrase. Office 2013 and newer use a slow key derivation, so a long random password may never turn up. Without a video card the program warns you about the expected time first, and a card makes the search faster.

## Unprotect Word document restrictions

Editing protection set with Restrict Editing inside a .docx is not encryption, so nothing has to be guessed. To unlock a Word document with this kind of lock, the program removes that flag from your own file in seconds. After you register, it saves the result as a docx file you can edit again.

![Word Password Recovery screenshot 3](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/wpr/wpr-v1-searching.png)

## Who needs a word password remover

- Admins who get a request from a user who forgot the Word document password of a protected report.
- Office staff who locked a template years ago and no longer remember how.
- Small teams with old Word files from a colleague who has left.

## Trial and license

The package installs the free trial of a commercial word password remover. Full use needs a license, and a license removes the trial limits: the password is shown in full and the unprotected copy can be saved. License types are listed on the [unlock your Word document](https://www.softorbits.net/word-password-recovery/?utm_source=chocolatey&amp;utm_medium=package) page.

## FAQ

### Is it possible to remove a password from a Word document?

Yes, with a word password remover on your own files. Editing protection is removed at once, and an open password is searched for with a dictionary and rules.

### How can I recover the password for a Word document I've forgotten?

Add the file and press Start. The program tries a list of likely words and patterns, and a registered copy shows the full result.

### How can I remove password protection from a Word document online?

You do not have to send the file anywhere. The program does the job on your computer, which keeps private documents private.
